## How Much Does a Spa Stay in Mariánské Lázně Cost?

Planning a spa holiday and wondering about the budget? Mariánské Lázně ranks among the most prestigious spa towns in Central Europe, yet offers therapeutic stays at noticeably more favourable prices than comparable resorts in Germany or Austria. In this guide you will find a price overview for 2026 — from a wellness weekend to a comprehensive three-week cure.

> **Please note:** The prices listed are approximate and may vary by season, room type, and chosen package. For up-to-date offers we recommend contacting your chosen hotel directly.

## Types of Stays and Price Ranges

Mariánské Lázně offers stays of varying length and focus. Your choice depends on your state of health, available time, and budget. The following overview will help you get your bearings among the main categories.

### Wellness Weekend (2–3 Nights)

The ideal option for a first encounter with the spa town. Wellness weekends include accommodation, half board, and access to the swimming pool, saunas, and fitness centre. Some packages also contain two or three treatments — for example a massage, wrap, or bath.

**Approximate price:** from CZK 4,000 to 10,000 (roughly €150–400) for the entire stay per person.

### One-Week Therapeutic Stay (7 Nights)

A seven-day stay is the minimum needed to begin genuine spa treatment. Over the week you will undergo an initial medical consultation, receive an individual treatment plan, and complete approximately two to three procedures per day. This is enough to bring noticeable improvement to the musculoskeletal system, ease stress, or kick-start your body's regeneration.

**Approximate price:** from CZK 12,000 to 30,000 (roughly €500–1,200) for the entire stay per person.

### Two-Week Recuperation Stay (14 Nights)

A fortnight represents the gold standard of spa treatment. The body has sufficient time to adapt and the therapeutic effects deepen. Treatments include mineral baths, CO₂ therapy, paraffin wraps, electrotherapy, and other specialised procedures according to your diagnosis.

**Approximate price:** from CZK 25,000 to 62,000 (roughly €1,000–2,500) for the entire stay per person.

### Comprehensive Cure (21 Nights)

A three-week stay corresponds to the traditional comprehensive cure as recommended by balneologists. At this length the full healing potential of the [mineral springs](/en/mineral-springs) and treatments comes into its own. Many guests report significant improvement in chronic complaints that persists for months after returning home.

**Approximate price:** from CZK 37,000 to 87,000 (roughly €1,500–3,500) for the entire stay per person.

